# Bulky, regeneratable local caches (prices/features/models) stay untracked --
# but training_runs/ is small, human-readable, append-only history (every
# past run's tickers/metrics/threshold-sweep) that should never live only on
# one machine's disk. See storage/training_run_store.py.
data/*
!data/training_runs/
bazel-*
.claude/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.bazelrc.user
.idea/
typescript/node_modules/
typescript/dist/
typescript/*.tsbuildinfo
